vg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><path d="M3 3.25h10v7.5H8.4L5.5 13.3v-2.55H3z"></path><path d="M8 5.4v2.4"></path><path d="M8 9.3v.01"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">Important</p><p>Shapes are immutable: every transform returns a new shape.</p></div></div><div class="callout callout-warning" role="note"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><path d="M8 2.6 14.1 13H1.9z"></path><path d="M8 6.5v3"></path><path d="M8 11.3v.01"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">Warning</p><p>A polygon whose edges cross has no defined area.</p></div></div><div class="callout callout-caution" role="note"><span class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5.5 2.5h5l3 3v5l-3 3h-5l-3-3v-5z"></path><path d="M8 5.3v3.2"></path><path d="M8 10.6v.01"></path></svg></span><div class="callout-body"><p class="callout-label">Caution</p><p><code>Shapes.parse</code> reads untrusted text: limit its input size.</p><p>It allocates one object per vertex.</p></div></div></section><section class="guide-section" aria-labelledby="a-plain-quote"><h2 id="a-plain-quote" class="doc-heading guide-heading">A plain quote<a class="heading-anchor" href="alerts.html#a-plain-quote" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2><blockquote><p>Geometry is the art of correct reasoning from incorrectly drawn figures.</p></blockquote></section><section class="guide-section" aria-labelledby="raw-html"><h2 id="raw-html" class="doc-heading guide-heading">Raw HTML<a class="heading-anchor" href="alerts.html#raw-html" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2><p>Press <span class="raw"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd></span>+<span class="raw"><kbd>C</kbd></span> to copy. Water is H<span class="raw"><sub>2</sub></span>O, and E = mc<span class="raw"><sup>2</sup></span>.</p><div class="raw"><dl>
  <dt>Area</dt>
  <dd>The size of the inside.</dd>
</dl></div><div class="raw"><hr></div><p>Back to the <a href="index.html#shapes">concepts</a>.</p></section></div><nav class="guide-pager" aria-label="Previous and next guides"><a class="guide-pager-link guide-prev" rel="prev" href="index.html"><span class="guide-pager-dir">Previous</span><span class="guide-pager-title">Concepts</span></a><a class="guide-pager-link guide-next" rel="next" href="images.html"><span class="guide-pager-dir">Next</span><span class="guide-pager-title">Pictures</span></a></nav></article></main><footer class="footer"><p><a href="alerts.md">This page as Markdown</a>, <a href="../../llms.txt">llms.txt</a>, <a href="../../api.json">api.json</a><span data-js-only="true">, <button type="button" class="footer-keys" data-keys-open="true" aria-keyshortcuts="?">Keyboard shortcuts</button></span></p></footer></div></body></html>
